[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3284297396","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110447#issuecomment-3284297396","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110447","id":3284297396,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Dwma0","user":{"login":"comminux","id":14937307,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0OTM3MzA3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14937307?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/comminux","html_url":"https://github.com/comminux","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/comminux/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/comminux/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/comminux/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/comminux/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/comminux/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/comminux/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/comminux/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/comminux/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/comminux/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-12T08:31:35Z","updated_at":"2025-09-16T15:43:46Z","body":"I don’t know how relevant my proposal is, but I can suggest the following construction:\n\n```gdscript\nvar vsync_mode: int = ProjectSettings.get_setting(\"display/window/vsync/vsync_mode\") # or DisplayServer.window_get_vsync_mode()\nmatch vsync_mode:\n\t0:\n\t\t# VSYNC_DISABLED\n\t\tpass\n\t1:\n\t\t# VSYNC_ENABLED\n\t\tpass\n\t2:\n\t\t# VSYNC_ADAPTIVE\n\t\tpass\n\t3:\n\t\t# VSYNC_MAILBOX\n\t\tpass\n```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3284297396/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3298114709","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110447#issuecomment-3298114709","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110447","id":3298114709,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ElTyV","user":{"login":"GlitchedCode922","id":126592994,"node_id":"U_kgDOB4un4g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/126592994?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GlitchedCode922","html_url":"https://github.com/GlitchedCode922","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GlitchedCode922/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GlitchedCode922/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GlitchedCode922/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GlitchedCode922/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GlitchedCode922/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GlitchedCode922/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GlitchedCode922/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GlitchedCode922/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GlitchedCode922/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-16T11:42:33Z","updated_at":"2025-09-16T11:42:33Z","body":"It's actually not a bug in DisplayServer, but how enums are defined in built-in classes: When you declare an enum in a script, it becomes a constant dictionary, so it has `keys`, `values`, `duplicate` and all the other methods. Engine enums don't have these features since they are just integer constants.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3298114709/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimiz